1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,000
For referral reviewers: check the supplied documents,
inspect the evidence, and prepare a human-reviewed handoff.

2
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:20,000
These synthetic documents contain different dates of birth.
Both source quotes remain visible; the system does not choose an identity.

3
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:30,000
The reviewer keeps the identity issue unresolved and records a reason.
Human corrections stay separate from original source facts.

4
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:40,000
After both items are handled, create a confirmed local snapshot.
The unresolved identity warning remains prominent.

5
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:50,000
In the missing-report case, load a prepared source revision.
The earlier result becomes read-only; no model is called.

6
00:00:50,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Load the prepared result for the added synthetic report.
The new result has no attachment finding and does not inherit old decisions.

7
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:10,000
Export the reviewed version-2 handoff with source references.
This is an actual local text export, not a server or clinical approval.

8
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:20,000
Offline baseline, Fake and replay counts expose failures and limitations.
Real-model evaluation, operator review and final release are still pending.
